@doc 
A Gemini server.

This documentation is largely for server internals. The authors do not really
know how to use EDoc, so please bear with us.

Dynamic content is produced by servlets; the contract a servlet module
must meet is described, in three layers (module, servlet process,
gateway), in {@link blizanci_servlet}, with the container's side of the
last two in {@link blizanci_servlet_container}.

@end
